text LavenderTown_Mart_Text_SearchingForStatRaiseItems {
    "I'm searching for items that raise\n"
    "the stats of Pokémon.\p"
    "They're effective over the course\n"
    "of a single battle.\p"
    "X Attack, X Defend, X Speed, \n"
    "and X Special are what I'm after.\p"
    "Do you know where I can get them?$"
}

text LavenderTown_Mart_Text_DidYouBuyRevives {
    "Did you buy some Revives?\n"
    "They revive any fainted Pokémon!$"
}

text LavenderTown_Mart_Text_TrainerDuosCanChallengeYou {
    "Sometimes, a Trainer duo will\n"
    "challenge you with two Pokémon\l"
    "at the same time.\p"
    "If that happens, you have to send\n"
    "out two Pokémon to battle, too.$"
}

text LavenderTown_Mart_Text_SoldNuggetFromMountainsFor5000 {
    "この　あいだ　やまおくで\n"
    "きんのたまを　ひろい　ましてね！\p"
    "つかえない　しなもの　ですが\n"
    "うったら　なんと　5000¥でした$"
}
